      "romanization": "muṇṭuṁ sāriyuṁ enna ōrmma",
      "gloss": "cold retrieval of the four worn things, and of an adjective that has not moved since the chapter that taught it",
      "script": "malayalam",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
